A comment-only line in a line block is removed before any inline run

```
::: |
a `b
%% secret
c
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>a <code>b

c</code></p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
a
%% secret
c
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>a<br>
<br>
c</p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
a `b
x %% secret
c
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>a <code>b
x %% secret
c</code></p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
a
%% c
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>a<br>
</p>
</div>
```
